==English==
[[Image:Speed bump (asphalt).jpg|thumb|A speed bump]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[speed]] [[bump]]}}

# A [[traffic calming]] measure, consisting of a [[transverse]] [[ridge]] in the [[road]], to [[limit]] the speed of [[vehicle]]s.

====Derived terms====
* [[Newfoundland speed bump]]

====Synonyms====
* [[judder bar]] {{qualifier|New Zealand}}, [[ramp]], [[sleeping policeman]], [[speed hump]]

